{"hymn":"S670","parent":"E1257","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"¿Los has visto en las ciudades","subtitle":"La iglesia—Su expresión local","syl":{"n1":"¿Los","n2":"has","n3":["vis","i"],"n4":["to‿en","t"],"n5":"las","n6":["ciu","i"],"n7":["da","m"],"n8":["des,","t"],"n9":"En","n10":"el","n11":["te","i"],"n12":["rre","m"],"n13":["no","t"],"n14":["lo","i"],"n15":["cal?","t"],"n17":"Son","n18":"los","n19":["can","i"],"n20":["de","m"],"n21":["le","m"],"n22":["ros","t"],"n23":["de‿o","i"],"n24":["ro,","t"],"n26":["Don","i"],"n27":["de","t"],"n28":["Cris","i"],"n29":["to‿en","m"],"n30":["cuen","m"],"n31":["tra‿ho","m"],"n32":["gar.","t"],"n33":"¡Qué","n34":["glo","i"],"n35":["rio","m"],"n36":["sa‿i","m"],"n37":["gle","m"],"n38":["sia!","t"],"n39":"Sin","n40":["man","i"],"n41":["cha‿al","m"],"n42":["gu","m"],"n43":["na:","t"],"n44":["Lle","i"],"n45":["na","t"],"n46":"de","n47":["glo","i"],"n48":["ria","t"],"n49":"de","n50":"Dios.","n51":"¡Qué","n52":["glo","i"],"n53":["rio","m"],"n54":["sa‿i","m"],"n55":["gle","m"],"n56":["sia!","t"],"n57":"Sin","n58":["man","i"],"n59":["cha‿al","m"],"n60":["gu","m"],"n61":["na:","t"],"n62":["Lle","i"],"n63":["na","t"],"n64":"de","n65":["glo","i"],"n66":["ria","t"],"n67":"de","n68":"Dios."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["¿Los has visto en las reuniones,","Levantando allí su voz?","Cada hermano compartiendo","Las riquezas del Señor."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["¿Oyes mientras oran-leen","La Palabra al inhalar?","Oran, cantan, beben, fluyen","El Señor al disfrutar."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["¿Has oído como invocan","Al decir: \"Señor Jesús\"?","Dulce nombre que proclaman","Con amor y gratitud."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["¿Oyes tú sus aleluyas?","Como fuertes truenos son:","¡Aleluya! ¡Aleluya!","¡Cristo al diablo ya venció!"]},{"label":"6.","lines":["¿Ven los santos emigrando?","El mover es del Señor;","Cada iglesia edificando","Para que vuelva el Señor."]},{"label":"7.","lines":["¿Ves que pronto viene Cristo","Por la iglesia que Él compró?","Él prepara, en las iglesias,","Esa novia que Él deseó."]}]}